### BACKEND

**Règle générale** : remplacer toutes les comparaisons et assignations de valeurs d'enum par leurs équivalents UPPER_SNAKE_CASE.

**`src/controllers/webhookController.js`**

Fonction `computeAggregateStatus` (lignes 114-122) :
```js
// AVANT
if (!statuses.length) return lease.opensignStatus || 'pending';
if (statuses.includes('declined')) return 'declined';
if (statuses.includes('expired')) return 'expired';
if (statuses.every((status) => status === 'completed')) return 'completed';
if (statuses.includes('signed') || statuses.includes('completed')) return 'signed';
return 'pending';
// APRÈS
if (!statuses.length) return lease.opensignStatus || 'PENDING';
if (statuses.includes('DECLINED')) return 'DECLINED';
if (statuses.includes('EXPIRED')) return 'EXPIRED';
if (statuses.every((status) => status === 'COMPLETED')) return 'COMPLETED';
if (statuses.includes('SIGNED') || statuses.includes('COMPLETED')) return 'SIGNED';
return 'PENDING';
```

